      ],
      "description": "On each new pregnancy, appends the mother's and father's names, the mother's age at conception, both head and body values, and the number of babies to 'Virtual Villagers 4 Parentage Log N.txt' beside the game executable. Parentage is not stored in any villager record, so both parents are captured at conception; they cannot be recovered from the child afterwards. Village seeding is excluded, so a new village does not write a record for every starting villager. Rolls to a new numbered file every 256 records. The game keeps only the father's name on the mother's record. His HEAD and BODY are copied onto her at conception, so the log reads them from her record and they stay correct even after he dies or another villager takes his name. His AGE is not recorded: no game copies it onto her, and the child's age derives from the mother's, so the log carries hers alone.",
